    "notes": "A short tape. This is all that exists. Please spread this around as it is not easy to find.\n\nUploaded to Tol September 21 2003 by Julian (Jools) Elliott\n\nInfo from Jeff Tiedrich's Resources for Tapers:\n09/04/67 - Dance Hall, Rio Nido, CA\nSoundboard: a fragment of Caution > Feedback\nreel master>1 cassette generation>DAT>circulation [6 minutes]\nNote: Found on the Latvala's cassette of 9/3/67. Date may be incorrect.",
